<title>USA: TABLE - Brooks Automation Q3 net loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Brooks Automation Q3 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>CHELMSFORD, Mass. 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine Months Ended  Three Months Ended</p>
<p>					June 30,	     June 30,</p>
<p>				   1997	  1996    1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenues		    $55,603    $66,446 $23,059   $25,280</p>
<p> Cost of revenues	   38,094     38,478  15,428    14,813</p>
<p> Gross profit		 17,509     27,968   7,631    10,467</p>
<p>Operating expenses:</p>
<p> Research and development  9,722	9,023   3,614     3,288</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>  administrative	     8,979	9,183   3,442     3,410</p>
<p>Income (loss) from</p>
<p>  operations		 (1,192)	9,762     575     3,769</p>
<p>Interest (income)</p>
<p>  expense, net		   399	 (29)     158	  48</p>
<p>Income (loss) before income</p>
<p>  taxes			(1,591)	9,791     417     3,721</p>
<p>Income tax provision</p>
<p>  (benefit)		    (354)	3,459     150     1,346</p>
