<p>  and common		   7,614	8,221   8,439     8,184</p>
<p>equivalent shares</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said it attributes lower revenues in the first nine months of 1997, compared to the same period last year, to a broad decline in the semiconductor manufacturing industry.</p>
<p>The company said reduced earnings for the current nine-month period are due to underutilization of manufacturing capacity stemming from lower revenue levels and increased global support costs related to the growth of its customer base worldwide.</p>
<p>Full name is Brooks Automation Inc.</p>
